  "steps": [
    "To a blender add: 250g soaked moong dal, 1/2 tsp turmeric powder, 1 tsp coriander powder, 1/2 tsp chilli powder, 1 tsp salt, 150ml water.",
    "Blend it into a nice smooth batter.",
    "Now, heat a pan on medium heat and add 1 tbsp oil.",
    "Pour in the prepared batter and spread it out evenly into a pizza base.",
    "Let it cook for about 3 minutes until the bottom is nice and crispy.",
    "Flip it over, and on the crispy side add: 3 tbsp pizza sauce, 1/3 tsp oregano, 30g mozzarella cheese, 10g capsicum, 10g tomato, 10g onion, 50g low-fat paneer, another 30g mozzarella cheese.",
    "Finally, sprinkle: 1/4 tsp chilli flakes, 1/4 tsp oregano, 1/4 tsp salt, 1/4 tsp black pepper.",
    "Sprinkle a little water around the sides of the pan, cover and bring the flame to low.",
    "After about 2 minutes, once the cheese is beautifully melted, remove the lid.",
    "And your High Protein Moong Dal Veg Pizza is ready!"
  ],
